# Build context for the Jitsi Meet web image. Without this the ~1.3 GB of
# node_modules is uploaded to the daemon on every build (and the builder stage
# regenerates them with `npm ci` anyway), which slows the build and fills the
# disk. Only the web app sources are needed to run `make all`.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
.junio
.qoder
coverage
dist
build
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Native / mobile trees that `make all` (web) never compiles.
android
ios
twa
react-native-sdk
tests
